        <p>NEW SERIES OF TIES.</p>
        <p>The following ties have been drawn in the third round of the Championship Competition, to be played off on any date up to the 9th July :—Hazel Grove v. Wigan at Prestwich ; Whitefield v. Radcliffe, at Tyldesley ; War- rington Cemetery v. Warrington South, at Croft's Bank; Broughton or Tyldesley v. Harpurhey or Withington, not arranged. Junior Competition :—Old Trafford v. Kersal Moor, at Chertham (Temple) ; Urmston (Nelson) v. Cheatham Hill, at Timperley ; Stockport Great Moor v. Newton-le-Willows, at Urtnston (Victoria) ; Croft's Bank v. Ashton-on-Mersey, at Withington. On any date up to the 25th June. Second team contest (second round) :—Leigh v. Tyldesley. at Old Trafford ; Radcliffe v. Whitefield, at Knsal Moor ; Withington v. Warring ton North, at Stretford ; Lower Broughton v. Warring- tonHouth, at Croft's Bank; Wilmslow v. Newton-le- Willows, at Brook's Bar ; Timperley V. Stretford, and Pendleton byes.</p>
