        <p>WITH ONE VOICE—Dr. Williams' Pink Pills are praised by all classes of people, from the lowest to the highest in the land, for the way in which they have cured paralysis, locomotor ataxy, rheumatism, and sciatica: also all diseases arising from impoverishment of the blood, scrofula, rickets, chronic erysipelas, consumption of the b(4wels and lungs, armmia, pale arid sallow cons- plexion, general muscular weakness, loss of appetite. palpitations, pains in the back, nervous headache and neuralgia, early decay, all forms of female weaknesS. and hysteria. These pills are a tonic, not a purgative,. they are genuine only with the full name, Dr. Williams Pink Pills for Pale People, awl are sold by chemists and by Dr. Williams' Medicine Company, 46, Holborn Via- duct, London, E.C., at 23 91 a box, or six boxes for 133 91. Pink Pills sold loose or from glass jars are not Dr. Williams' Pink Pills; accept them only in the pink closed wrapper as above described.</p>
